You are working in /tmp/sv-aa4ea583b981465b9d17c4523e19794e/ShipmentTracker. This is a Blazor Web App with Interactive Auto (global) and Individual authentication. The solution has two projects:
- ShipmentTracker (server): /tmp/sv-aa4ea583b981465b9d17c4523e19794e/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/
- ShipmentTracker.Client (WebAssembly): /tmp/sv-aa4ea583b981465b9d17c4523e19794e/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/

The app tracks shipments for a logistics company. Implement the following:

## 1. Shared Models (in .Client project since interactive components need them)

Create `/tmp/sv-aa4ea583b981465b9d17c4523e19794e/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Models/Shipment.cs`:
```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public class ShipmentDto
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public ShipmentStatus Status { get; set; }
    public DateTime ShippedDate { get; set; }
    public DateTime EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public string CustomerEmail { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Description { get; set; } = string.Empty;
}

public enum ShipmentStatus
{
    Pending,
    PickedUp,
    InTransit,
    OutForDelivery,
    Delivered,
    Exception
}
```

## 2. Service Interface (in .Client project)

Create `/tmp/sv-aa4ea583b981465b9d17c4523e19794e/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/IShipmentService.cs`:
```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public interface IShipmentService
{
    Task<List<ShipmentDto>> GetAllShipmentsAsync();
    Task<ShipmentDto?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber);
    Task<List<ShipmentDto>> GetShipmentsByCustomerAsync(string customerEmail);
    Task<ShipmentDto> CreateShipmentAsync(ShipmentDto shipment);
    Task<ShipmentDto> UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus status);
}
```

## 3. Client-side Implementation (HttpClient-based, in .Client project)

Create `/tmp/sv-aa4ea583b981465b9d17c4523e19794e/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/ShipmentHttpService.cs`:
```csharp
using System.Net.Http.Json;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public class ShipmentHttpService : IShipmentService
{
    private readonly HttpClient _http;

    public ShipmentHttpService(HttpClient http)
    {
        _http = http;
    }

    public async Task<List<ShipmentDto>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        return await _http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<ShipmentDto>>("api/shipments") ?? [];
    }

    public async Task<ShipmentDto?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        return await _http.GetFromJsonAsync<ShipmentDto?>($"api/shipments/track/{trackingNumber}");
    }

    public async Task<List<ShipmentDto>> GetShipmentsByCustomerAsync(string customerEmail)
    {
        return await _http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<ShipmentDto>>($"api/shipments/customer/{Uri.EscapeDataString(customerEmail)}") ?? [];
    }

    public async Task<ShipmentDto> CreateShipmentAsync(ShipmentDto shipment)
    {
        var response = await _http.PostAsJsonAsync("api/shipments", shipment);
        response.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();
        return (await response.Content.ReadFromJsonAsync<ShipmentDto>())!;
    }

    public async Task<ShipmentDto> UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus status)
    {
        var response = await _http.PutAsJsonAsync($"api/shipments/{id}/status", status);
        response.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();
        return (await response.Content.ReadFromJsonAsync<ShipmentDto>())!;
    }
}
```

## 4. Register HttpClient and service in Client Program.cs

Edit `/tmp/sv-aa4ea583b981465b9d17c4523e19794e/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Program.cs` to add:
```csharp
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.WebAssembly.Hosting;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

var builder = WebAssemblyHostBuilder.CreateDefault(args);

builder.Services.AddAuthorizationCore();
builder.Services.AddCascadingAuthenticationState();
builder.Services.AddAuthenticationStateDeserialization();

builder.Services.AddHttpClient<IShipmentService, ShipmentHttpService>(client =>
{
    client.BaseAddress = new Uri(builder.HostEnvironment.BaseAddress);
});

await builder.Build().RunAsync();
```

Wait — `AddHttpClient` is not available in WebAssembly. Instead use:
```csharp
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.WebAssembly.Hosting;
